      "spam": false,
      "value": "Buttons are nice, and I would like this feature too, but I do fear buttons being too sensitive, much like world buttons are.  You might accidently press them while either reaching for something else, or otherwise.\n\nBut yes, I'd like some buttons, click a button to play an emote animation,  activate particles (so I don't have to use up a hand gesture) or even change textures!\n\nMaybe even add custom avatar specific menu items.  A special menu for avatar specific functions that can have multiple things you can do.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
